  description: "[ Pendulum Effect ] \nDuring your Main Phase: You can send 1 \"Clown
    Crew\" card from your Deck to your GY, except a Pendulum Monster, and if you
    do, Special Summon this card, also you cannot activate the effects of monsters
    Special Summoned from the Deck or Extra Deck until the end of the next turn.
    You can only use this effect of \"Clown Crew Cappello\" once per turn.\n\n[ Monster
    Effect ] \nMonsters your opponent controls lose 1500 DEF while you control a
    Tribute Summoned monster. If this card is Tributed: You can activate 1 of these
    effects (but you can only use each of these effects of \"Clown Crew Cappello\"
    once per turn);\r\n\u25CF Shuffle all Pendulum Monsters on the field and face-up
    in the Extra Decks into the Deck.\r\n\u25CF Special Summon 1 non-Pendulum \"Clown
    Crew\" monster from your Deck or Extra Deck, ignoring its Summoning conditions."
